[Music]  it was a swift and bold move in response  to a complex Middle East crisis which  has dragged on for six long years a  barrage of American cruise missiles  directed at a Syrian Air Base after an  alleged chemical attack by Syria's  president against his own people just  two days earlier  tonight I ordered a targeted military  strike on the airfield in Syria from  where the chemical attack was launched  it is in this vital national security  interest of the United States to prevent  and deter the spread and use of deadly  chemical weapons syrian state television  run pictures of what it said was the  missile strike it has denied carrying  out a chemical attack suggesting it  could have hit a rebel stockpile of  chemicals during an air strike Syria has  condemned what it says are its efforts  to thwart terrorism in its own country  this condemnable u.s. aggression  confirms the continuation of the flawed  u.s. strategy and undermines the process  of combating terrorism that the Syrian  military is undertaking 59 Tomahawk  cruise missiles were fired from two US  warships in the eastern Mediterranean  towards the sharat airbase in homs  province which is around a hundred  kilometers from concha Kune the scene of  the alleged attack President Trump says  the sharat airbase was used to launch  the chemical attack against Syrian  civilians this is what prompted him to  act more than 80 people were killed and  many many more battled poisonous  chemicals probably sarin gas unleashed  on their town Britain says it doesn't  think this is the start of an extensive  campaign against the Syrian regime we  fully supported and the Americans  believe that this action is limited  it's very narrowly focused against the  airfield the aircraft and the equipment  that the Americans believe were used in  the gas attack and they have exhausted  all other means whether by coincidence  all designed president Trump's missile  strike happened when the leader of the  world's other superpower China arrived  in America for their fur  meeting the strike leaves Donald Trump  looking at the very least decisive in  front of Xi Jinping who has the power to  influence another nation threatening  global stability North Korea the world  is starting to see what kind of foreign  policy Donald Trump intends to pursue  Lisa Holland Sky News

